<title>USA: Thomas Nelson sells unit to Salem Comms.</title>
<headline>Thomas Nelson sells unit to Salem Comms.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thomas Nelson Inc said it had sold its Morningstar Radio Network Inc to Salem Radio Network, a unit of Salem Communications Corp.</p>
<p>In a statement, Thomas Nelson said Morningstar produces, syndicates and distributes two 24-hour Christian music formats to more than 160 affiliated radio stations.</p>
<p>Terms were not announced.</p>
<p>-- New York newsroom, (212) 859-1610</p>
